	"_note": "Fumi keeps the Hanami teahouse in Sakurazaka (the village's east part) and lives at its back. She opens at 9:00 and pours tea behind her counter (the shop teahouse, data/shops.json) until noon, sweeps the gravel in front after lunch (13:00-14:00), takes a walk over the bridge and back, then the counter again until 17:30; asleep from 21:00. Wet days she stays at her counter all day. Married to the farmer (married_fumi, data/marriage.json) she lives at the farmhouse: by the kotatsu in the second room before 8:50 and from 18:00, the teahouse as before in between. On her birthday (spring 26, the last of the cherries) she shuts the counter at 11:00 and stands under the cherry trees by the bridge until 16:00. Her heart events: data/events/heart_fumi.json (band 3), heart_fumi_5.json (band 5), heart_fumi_6.json (band 6; after it she can be asked to marry, data/marriage.json). Gifts: tea and sweets (dango, sakura mochi), flowers of the season; no fish. Format: README.md, Villagers.",
